Via other European languages, ultimately borrowed from {{bor|lv|km|Kambuja}} (modern Khmer ''{{l|km|កម្ពុជា|tr=kampuciə}}''), itself a [[Appendix:Glossary#borrowing|borrowing]] from {{der|lv|sa|काम्बोज|tr=kāmbōja}}, the name of a tribe mentioned in Hindu scripture.

